 "sentences": [
  "A jury acquitted an assassin in 1921.",
  "On 15 March 1921, Soghomon Tehlirian killed Talaat Pasha in Berlin.",
  "Talaat was the main architect of the Armenian genocide and a former grand vizier.",
  "Tehlirian lost most of his family in the genocide and joined Operation Nemesis.",
  "Talaat had already been sentenced to death by an Ottoman court-martial.",
  "He successfully argued he killed a man but was not a murderer."
